 # Change Log
 
+## Release 36 - February 11th, 2026
+
+### Highlights
+* New `MNoSeatbelts` component for displaying standardized warnings before dangerous or irreversible actions.
+* New `MLazyLoader` component for lazy-loading content with customizable loading states.
+
+### Under the hood changes
+* **Added**: `MInputSingleSelectDropdown` now supports a `small` size variant for use in compact UI layouts.
+* **Added**: `MInputText` now supports a `small` size variant for use in compact UI layouts.
+* **Added**: `MInputNumber` now supports a `small` size variant for use in compact UI layouts.
+
+* **Changed**: `MCallout` now supports an `icon` slot for custom title icons.
+* **Changed**: `MInputHintMessage` now supports multi-line hints.
+* **Changed**: `MDateTime` tooltips no longer show milliseconds for improved readability.
+* **Changed**: `MInputText` no longer accepts `undefined` for its `modelValue` prop. Initialize the bound value to an empty string instead.
+* **Changed**: `MInputSingleSelectRadio` now has a slight gap between vertical radio options for improved readability.
+
+* **Fixed**: `MInputDateTime` incorrectly limiting minimum and maximum times if the range had a timezone offset and straddled midnight.
+* **Fixed**: `MListItem` now emits a click event if the `clickable` prop is set.
+* **Fixed**: The `MInputNumber` component now behaves correctly when the input is empty and the up/down arrow buttons are used.
+* **Fixed**: `MPageOverviewCard` now correctly wraps long text in titles and subtitles and truncates long IDs.
+* **Fixed**: `MButton` now displays a placeholder text if used only with the icon slot and no label.
+* **Fixed**: `MRootLayout` now correctly wraps long page titles on the header bar.
+
